            "icon": "compress",
            "iconTheme": "material-symbols-rounded",
            "quickSelectKey": "X",
            "angle": 180
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "请用通俗中文解释，避免不必要的术语，并给一个具体例子。"
            },
            "name": "通俗解释",
            "icon": "lightbulb",
            "iconTheme": "material-symbols-rounded",
            "quickSelectKey": "Z",
            "angle": 225
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "请给我三个可行方案，说明各自取舍，并明确推荐一个。"
            },
            "name": "三个方案",
            "icon": "account_tree",
            "iconTheme": "material-symbols-rounded",
            "quickSelectKey": "A",
            "angle": 270
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "请继续推进，不必每一步都向我确认；只有遇到会显著影响结果的关键分歧时再问我。"
            },
            "name": "继续推进",
            "icon": "forward",
            "iconTheme": "material-symbols-rounded",
            "quickSelectKey": "Q",
            "angle": 315
          }
        ]
      },
      "shortcut": "Control+1",
